    "ogImage": "/assets/heartopia-guide-hero.png",
    "content": "<section class=\"wiki-hero\">\n        <div class=\"wiki-hero-inner\">\n          <span class=\"top-note\">2026 年 6 月 6 日更新 · 公开资料快照</span>\n          <h1>Heartopia 中文攻略、兑换码与数据库入口</h1>\n          <p>这里把玩家最常查的路线放在首页：兑换码、地图区域、商店、钓鱼点、作物收益、料理资料、宠物、房屋灵感和新手进度。</p>\n          <div class=\"hero-buttons\">\n            <a class=\"pastel-button\" href=\"/zh-hans/codes/\">查看兑换码</a>\n            <a class=\"pastel-button alt\" href=\"/zh-hans/guides/\">新手路线</a>\n            <a class=\"pastel-button alt\" href=\"/zh-hans/database/\">浏览数据库</a>\n            <a class=\"pastel-button alt\" href=\"/zh-hans/shops/\">查找商店</a>\n            <a class=\"pastel-button alt\" href=\"/zh-hans/tools/\">打开工具</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"platform-row\" aria-label=\"平台说明\">\n            <span class=\"data-pill\">PC</span>\n            <span class=\"data-pill\">iOS</span>\n            <span class=\"data-pill\">Android</span>\n            <span class=\"data-pill\">Steam 路线</span>\n            <span class=\"data-pill\">粉丝维护</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-stats\">\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>15</strong><span>兑换码候选</span></div>\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>6</strong><span>主要地图区域</span></div>\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>10+</strong><span>钓鱼记录</span></div>\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>8</strong><span>商店记录</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"wiki-section media-section\">\n        <div class=\"wiki-shell\">\n          <div class=\"center-head\">\n            <h2>常用入口</h2>\n            <p>先从最容易影响进度的页面进入，再按需要查看完整数据表、地图和工具。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"asset-grid\">\n            <a class=\"asset-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/codes/\"><img src=\"/assets/asset-codes.jpg\" alt=\"Heartopia 兑换码奖励看板\" loading=\"eager\"><span class=\"asset-card-body\"><strong>兑换码与奖励</strong><span>优先测试有期限说明的兑换码，再复制其余候选。</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"asset-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/map/\"><img src=\"/assets/asset-map.jpg\" alt=\"Heartopia 地图路线标记\" loading=\"eager\"><span class=\"asset-card-body\"><strong>地图路线</strong><span>区域、动物食槽、NPC 地标和钓鱼点。</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"asset-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/fish/\"><img src=\"/assets/asset-fishing.jpg\" alt=\"Heartopia 钓鱼数据库\" loading=\"eager\"><span class=\"asset-card-body\"><strong>钓鱼数据库</strong><span>水域类型、稀有鱼路线、天气条件和等级门槛。</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"asset-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/crops/\"><img src=\"/assets/asset-gardening.jpg\" alt=\"Heartopia 作物规划\" loading=\"eager\"><span class=\"asset-card-body\"><strong>作物数据库</strong><span>成长时间、种子价格、收益对比和种植节奏。</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"asset-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/recipes/\"><img src=\"/assets/asset-events.jpg\" alt=\"Heartopia 料理路线\" loading=\"eager\"><span class=\"asset-card-body\"><strong>料理数据库</strong><span>食材、路线、料理风险和工具跳转。</span></span></a>\n            <a class=\"asset-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/animal-favorites/\"><img src=\"/assets/asset-pets.jpg\" alt=\"Heartopia 宠物与动物喂食\" loading=\"eager\"><span class=\"asset-card-body\"><strong>宠物与动物</strong><span>狗粮、食槽路线、Oak-Oak 和安全喂食测试。</span></span></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"wiki-section\">\n        <div class=\"wiki-shell\">\n          <div class=\"center-head\">\n            <h2>先做什么？</h2>\n            <p>如果你刚开始玩，建议按下面的顺序处理：领奖励、开地图、解锁基础爱好，再用工具规划金币和材料。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"route-grid\">\n            <a class=\"route-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/guides/\"><div class=\"icon-badge\">01</div><h3>新手路线</h3><p>先看 D.G. 等级、每日流程、爱好解锁和邮箱奖励。</p></a>\n            <a class=\"route-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/codes/\"><div class=\"icon-badge\">02</div><h3>兑换奖励</h3><p>按期限和奖励类型测试兑换码，减少手输错误。</p></a>\n            <a class=\"route-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/tools/profit-calculator/\"><div class=\"icon-badge\">03</div><h3>规划金币</h3><p>用作物收益工具比较番茄、土豆、小麦和离线种植节奏。</p></a>\n            <a class=\"route-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/map/\"><div class=\"icon-badge\">04</div><h3>找位置</h3><p>确认商店、NPC、动物、钓鱼点和区域路线。</p></a>\n            <a class=\"route-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/hobbies/\"><div class=\"icon-badge\">05</div><h3>爱好路线</h3><p>钓鱼、料理、园艺、观鸟、昆虫和宠物资料集中入口。</p></a>\n            <a class=\"route-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/about/\"><div class=\"icon-badge\">i18n</div><h3>翻译状态</h3><p>简中页面会逐步补齐；未完成页面会明确显示“翻译待补”。</p></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"wiki-section tint-mint\">\n        <div class=\"wiki-shell content\">\n          <h2 class=\"wiki-title\">关于这个中文版本</h2>\n          <p>Heartopia Hub 是独立粉丝资料站，不隶属于 Heartopia、开发者或发行方。当前中文站点采用逐页翻译：已经审核过的中文页面可以进入搜索和站点地图，仍使用英文来源内容的页面会保持 noindex，并显示翻译待补提示。</p>\n          <p>这让中文内容可以逐步发布，同时避免把英文正文伪装成已完成翻译。后续继续补充时，只需要在对应 locale 的翻译 overlay 中加入页面内容即可。</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>"
